{"id": "393903c3ed9a", "ts": "2026-10-25T08:47:38", "event": "tool_call", "tool": "compile_check", "permission": "sandboxed-exec", "server": "hw-sandbox", "args": {"code": "#include \"stm32g4xx.h\"\n\nvoid tim1_pa8_pwm_init(void) {\n    /* 1. Enable GPIOA and TIM1 peripheral clocks */\n    RCC->AHB2ENR |= RCC_AHB2ENR_GPIOAEN;\n    RCC->APB2ENR |= RCC_APB2ENR_TIM1EN;\n\n    /* 2. Configure PA8 as Alternate Function AF6 (TIM1_CH1) */\n    /* MODER8 = 10 (Alternate function mode) */\n    GPIOA->MODER &= ~GPIO_MODER_MODE8_Msk;\n    GPIOA->MODER |= (2U << GPIO_MODER_MODE8_Pos);\n    /* OTYPER8 = 0 (Push-pull) */\n    GPIOA->OTYPER &= ~GPIO_OTYPER_OT8;\n    /* OSPEEDR8 = 11 (Very high speed) */\n    GPIOA->OSPEEDR |= (3U << GPIO_OSPEEDR_OSPEED8_Pos);\n    /* PUPDR8 = 00 (No pull-up, no pull-down) */\n    GPIOA->PUPDR &= ~GPIO_PUPDR_PUPD8_Msk;\n    /* AF6 on PA8 -> AFR[1] (AFRH), pin 8 is AFSEL8 (bits 3:0) */\n    GPIOA->AFR[1] &= ~GPIO_AFRH_AFSEL8_Msk;\n    GPIOA->AFR[1] |= (6U << GPIO_AFRH_AFSEL8_Pos);\n\n    /* 3. Configure TIM1 for 20 kHz PWM, 25% duty cycle */\n    /* TIM1CLK = 170 MHz. Target freq = 20 kHz -> Prescaler = 0, ARR = 8499 */\n    TIM1->PSC = 0U;\n    TIM1->ARR = 8499U;\n    /* 25% duty cycle of 8500 counts = 2125 */\n    TIM1->CCR1 = 2125U;\n\n    /* Channel 1 PWM mode 1 (OC1M = 0110), Preload enable (OC1PE = 1) */\n    TIM1->CCMR1 &= ~TIM_CCMR1_OC1M_Msk;\n    TIM1->CCMR1 |= (TIM_CCMR1_OC1M_1 | TIM_CCMR1_OC1M_2);\n    TIM1->CCMR1 |= TIM_CCMR1_OC1PE;\n\n    /* Enable Auto-reload preload (ARPE) */\n    TIM1->CR1 |= TIM_CR1_ARPE;\n\n    /* Channel 1 output enable (CC1E = 1) */\n    TIM1->CCER |= TIM_CCER_CC1E;\n\n    /* Advanced timer TIM1: Main Output Enable (MOE = 1) */\n    TIM1->BDTR |= TIM_BDTR_MOE;\n\n    /* Generate an update event to load the prescaler and preload values */\n    TIM1->EGR |= TIM_EGR_UG;\n\n    /* Enable TIM1 counter (CEN = 1) */\n    TIM1->CR1 |= TIM_CR1_CEN;\n}\n", "chip": "stm32g474"}, "latency_ms": 263, "error": null, "session": "live-demo"}
